{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1429810-a-splat-in-progress-siten-uzu-2e-major-template","id":1429810,"title":"A Splat-In-Progress: Siten Uzu 2e Major Template","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-12-24T18:21:23-08:00","id":1429810,"title":"A Splat-In-Progress: Siten Uzu 2e Major Template","content":"Just a bit of background first. I loved the idea of Siten Uzu in 1e in theory. In practice, I was disappointed. A lot of their powers are just buying a lot of things Uratha get as part of their template for free, and at a premium price. There's only a handful of things that aren't. I've seen a few ideas batted around for 2e Siten Uzu, including Acro's on this forum. Unfortunately, they tend towards appropriate for NPCs rather than PCs, requiring a bit more interpretation to be appropriate for PCs. That's why I started this project.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1EWjyjBSS3w_O2XWGVLX5eNRl9jlHo1ggmSUPaL0KDiE/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1EWjyjBSS3w_O2XWGVLX5eNRl9jlHo1ggmSUPaL0KDiE/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1EWjyjBSS3w_O2XWGVLX5eNRl9jlHo1ggmSUPaL0KDiE/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/1EWjyjBSS3w_O2XWGVLX5eNRl9jlHo1ggmSUPaL0KDiE/edit?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> This project aims to make Siten Uzu as a major template in terms of power and variety. While a Siten Uzu campaign is possible in theory, it's more meant to crossover. Aside from their fox's enemies, who can be placated, they... really have as much trouble as they can get in. They're more meant to get involved in other splats' business, whether as an ally or enemy.<br /> <br /> Thematically, the Siten Uzu are meant to be a contrast to the other major splats in their relative humanity. As of posting, Siten Uzu retain their pre merger mind, even retaining Integrity. Is Integrity always the best way of coping in a world like the Chronicles of Darkness? They're as likely as any major splat to be able to settle down to some extent, but without being united against a common enemy to unite against, they have less to fall back on than other splats if someone does get pissed. They might be able to rely on the few Siten Uzu they actually know, but is that going to help if the local Uratha decide the Siten Uzu has violated the rules separating the flesh and the spirit in a way that goes beyond promising not to step sideways anymore? Of course, they can find friends in other splats - but they're probably going to have a hard time fitting in, and with their 'unique' powers, they're going to be expected to pull a few unorthodox duties.<br /> <br /> This is just a taste of the basic idea. I'm trying to solicit multiple points of view, and a few ideas for powers (or even old half-done projects to scrounge from) to get a better idea. Power wise, they're meant to be on par with wolves, vamps, and changelings. So far, I've got their X-Splat worked on, but I haven't figured out what their Y-Splat would be, without as much organization. I've also not decided whether I want to give them Influence as an option.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25382-tzauri","name":"Tzauri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-11T15:57:01-08:00","id":1502784,"title":"","content":"the docs i locked<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27385-cross-a-way","name":"Cross-a-way","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27385_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}